---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Terms & Conditions"
	description="Terms of service for Waliya Enterprizes."
>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-24">
		<h1 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			Terms &amp; Conditions
		</h1>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			Last updated: November 20, 2026
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			1. Agreement to Terms
		</h2>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			By accessing this website, you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not
			agree with any part of these terms, you are prohibited from using this site.
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			2. Services
		</h2>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			Waliya Enterprizes provides digital solutions and business services, including but not
			limited to website design, maintenance, graphic design, and digital marketing. Specific
			project scopes and deliverables will be agreed upon in separate client contracts.
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			3. Intellectual Property
		</h2>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			Unless otherwise stated, Waliya Enterprizes and/or its licensors own the intellectual
			property rights for all material on this website. You may not republish, sell, or reproduce
			our content without explicit permission.
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			4. Limitation of Liability
		</h2>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			In no event shall Waliya Enterprizes be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential
			damages arising out of the use or inability to use the materials on our website.
		</p>

		<h2 class="mt-8 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-dark-text">
			5. Governing Law
		</h2>
		<p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
			These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India.
		</p>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
